OL,3,AFormer German spy chief arrested for
OL,4,Aespionage and treason
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer German spy chief August Hanning
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fespionage, treason and obtaining
OL,9,Fclassified information for a foreign
OL,10,Fpower, the German Federal Prosecutor's
OL,11,FOffice says.
OL,13,FHanning headed the Federal Intelligence
OL,14,FService (BND) from 1998 to 2005 and has
OL,15,Fsince been working as a private
OL,16,Fconsultant.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
