OL,3,AWhite House defends Trump comment to
OL,4,Alet Iran 'take out' LA and San Diego
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump's remark that Iran could
OL,7,F"take out" Los Angeles and San Diego
OL,8,Fhas sparked fierce backlash from
OL,9,FCalifornia politicians - and a strongly
OL,10,Fworded rebuttal from the White House.
OL,12,FCalifornia Governor Gavin Newsom
OL,13,Fcondemned the comment - made by Trump
OL,14,Fat a campaign rally in Nebraska - as
OL,15,F"deranged and dangerous," while LA
OL,16,FMayor Karen Bass described them as
OL,17,Fthreats and an attempt to "encourage
OL,18,Fattacks on American lives".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
