OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhite House defends Trump comment to
OL,4,Alet Iran 'take out' LA and San Diego
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the White House, however,
OL,7,FTrump was saying that American cities
OL,8,Fwould have been threatened by Iran had
OL,9,Fhe not launched a war there earlier
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FBoth LA and San Diego house major US
OL,13,Fmilitary installations including Navy
OL,14,Fports and Air Force bases.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
